 "remarks": "Facing Franklin Street and UCONN. Sunny and Bright offices (presently occupied by Real Estate office). Two glass enclosed conference rooms. kitchenette and lovely reception area. Ideal as consulting, law firm, accounting or any professional use. HEAT included in rent. Tastefully renovated building recognized as AWARD WINNER for Best Facade--Granite, Brick & Stone. Lovely patio w garden & stone walkways. One of a Kind in downtown Stamford. Prime location, convenient to other professional buildings, the Town Center, Theaters, Restaurants, Stamford Parc, Mill River Park & RR. Neighboring tenants incl. Law Firm, IT & Marketing Co. on 2nd floor of truly elegant building. Flexible floor plan and lease terms, two hallway lavatories. Best location on Summer Street. Must see. Check MLS for other available adjacent suites with possible expansion. Appointment Only.",
